<title>ITALY: Gross yield 7.77 pct at Italy 10-yr BTP auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 7.77 pct at Italy 10-yr BTP auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a first tranche of 2.5 trillion lire of 10-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTP) carrying a 7.75 percent coupon.</p>
<p>		   November 1, 2006    previous July 1, 2006</p>
<p> Net Yield	  6.78 pct vs	6.99 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield	7.77 pct vs	8.10 pct</p>
<p> Assigned price  100.80    vs    105.30</p>
<p> Bids		 5.235 trillion lire</p>
<p> Assigned	   2.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - The rates are not directly comparable because the last auction on October 15 was of a 15th and final tranche of July 1, 2006 BTPs carrying an 8.75 pct coupon.</p>
</text>
